#Display string for package name

VTS=Versatile Tools Suite

VTS_NIC=Network Information Collection
VTS_NIC.InstallInfo = The Network Information Collection tool is used by customer service engineers to obtain the NE information, perform routine maintenance, analyze and identify faults, and perform health check. In addition, it acts as an assistant tool during deployment and acceptance.
VTS_NIC.UninstallInfo = The Network Information Collection tool is used by customer service engineers to obtain the NE information, perform routine maintenance, analyze and identify faults, and perform health check. In addition, it acts as an assistant tool during deployment and acceptance.

VTS_NIC_AS=Network Information Collection Server

VTS_NIC_DS=Network Information Collection Desktop Service

VTS_NIC_CLIENT=Network Information Collection Client

VTS_NIC_AS_DIST=Network Information Collection Server

VTS_NIC_DS_DIST=Network Information Collection Desktop Service

VTS_NIC_CLIENT_DIST=Network Information Collection Client
